Installation instructions for openBibleViewer 0.9.1 (macOS Apple Silicon)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Requirements:
  - macOS 13+ (Apple Silicon / arm64)
  - Qt 6.6+ (Core, Gui, Widgets, Xml, Network, Sql, PrintSupport,
             WebEngineWidgets, Qml, Core5Compat)
  - Xapian 1.4+ (full-text search engine, replaces CLucene)
  - zlib (compression)
  - CMake 3.16+
  - Apple Clang or equivalent C++17 compiler

Install dependencies via Homebrew:
  brew install cmake qt@6 xapian zlib

Note: Qt5WebKit is not available on Apple Silicon. This fork uses
Qt6 + Qt6WebEngineWidgets as the web rendering engine.

Build from source:
  cd openBibleViewer-0.9.1
  mkdir build && cd build
  cmake -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release ..
  cmake --build . -j$(sysctl -n hw.ncpu)

Create macOS app bundle and DMG:
  bash package.sh

The resulting DMG will be in dist/openBibleViewer-0.9.1-macOS-arm64.dmg.

To run the app bundle directly:
  open build/openBibleViewer.app
